cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: BeamOnTarget
abstract: >-
  A Python application for simulating the interaction of particle beams with
  complex 3D geometries. It tracks charged and neutral beam particles through
  user-supplied electromagnetic field maps and beam-gas interaction channels,
  and computes the power and power density deposited on the surfaces of
  triangulated meshes.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-18
license: LGPL-3.0-only

